    "ciesin:harvard_doi": "10.7910/DVN/RCIVH0",
    "ciesin:sedac_doi": "10.7927/H4VM496V",
    "ciesin:purpose": "To provide a map of the wildest areas in geographic projection which can be used in wildlife conservation planning, natural resource management, and research on human-environment interactions.",
    "ciesin:supplemental_info": "To reproduce this dataset, the following steps are recommended: 1) Classify the Human Footprint grid according to raster value (wild = 0-1; not wild >1). 2) Select and identify the top 1% of the wild areas within each biome by realm.",
